# Frontend (Next.js App Router)

## Files

- Split: page/container, presentational component, types, API call in `lib/`
- Reuse `components/` and `lib/` clients before adding new ones
- Tailwind utilities only — no inline CSS or ad-hoc style objects unless matching an existing exception (mockup theme vars in `globals.css` are allowed)

## UI states

Every data view must handle: loading, success, empty, error, retry. Disable submit while pending.

## Metrics

- Display values from server loaders / Route Handlers — never recompute cost-per / ROI in the client as the source of truth

## Quality

- Accessible: labels, keyboard, focus, meaningful ARIA where needed
- Responsive by default (see `web-responsive.mdc`); one job per page/section
